# PETAL PARADE: a sensible player wins. The demo player presses real
# buttons each frame: it collects pups, walks them along the sun circle and
# lets go when they all stand on it, drinks the jars and smashes brambles
# while the nectar runs, hops what it can't avoid, and keeps clear of the
# way each bramble is looking. It must save all 200 in one run.
seed 7
game petalparade
wait 20
botuntil state == 1 100
botuntil saved >= 50 8000
expect state == 1
botuntil state != 1 30000
expect state == 4
expect saved >= 200
expect goals & 2
